---
// /es-mx/projects, rebuilt from the live Duda page (2026-10-18).
// Same 52 photos in the same order as the live Spanish page (it has no Texas
// Regional photos, unlike /projects), with the live alt text, which is in
// English on live (flagged for the alt-text pass with /projects).
// Copy changes vs live:
// - <title> and meta description were English (meta had the old
//   (956) 867-0667 number); now Spanish with (956) 422-3335.
// - H1 "NUESTROS PROYECTOS" written in normal case (CSS uppercases it).
// - Added: breadcrumb, trust strip, tap-to-enlarge viewer, closing call band
//   (heading + line from the /es-mx homepage CTA), hreflang to /projects.
